json5/eigen-number
description: Hexadecimal integer, bare-point decimal, explicit plus, Infinity, or NaN
- >
  The number spellings JSON5 adds over JSON — hexadecimal integers, a decimal that leads or
  trails with a bare point, an explicit plus sign, and the IEEE 754 specials:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  0xC0FFEE   .5   42.   +1   Infinity   -Infinity   NaN
